### unquoted array assignment passed to eval
eval items=(a b c)
>>- SC1036 1:12 -- bash rejects the unquoted parenthesis, so this is reported as a parser syntax error
>>- SC1088 1:12 -- mvdan rejects this input, so it is reported as a syntax error, not as a lint code; the error stops at the same parenthesis
>>- SC1098 1:12 -- mvdan rejects this input, so it is reported as a syntax error, not as a lint code whose message says to quote the arguments of eval

### quoted array assignment
eval "items=(a b c)"
>>> none

### escaped parentheses
eval items=\(a b c\)
>>> none
